  description: "Target 1 \"Utopic Future\" Xyz Monster you control; apply the following
    effect(s) to that monster you control for the rest of this turn.\r\n\u25CF It
    can attack all monsters your opponent controls once each.\r\n\u25CF If it battles
    an opponent's monster, that monster's effects are negated during the Damage Step
    only.\r\n\u25CF Each time it destroys an opponent's monster by battle, inflict
    damage to your opponent equal to the destroyed monster's original ATK.\r\nYou
    can only activate 1 \"Future Drive\" per turn."
